  'quadroComparativo[4].s': 'The polling keeps him steady around 3% while the price gives way for a fourth day. A series caveat, and it is a large one: his maximum in the AFOS series is 10.10%, from Apr 26, so 0.35% is less than a twentieth of that level and moves of 0.20pp in that range carry almost no informational value.',
  'quadroComparativo[5].t': 'FLAT at 3.10%, with no variation across the eight readings of today\'s four guard rounds.',
